<title>USA: SOCCER-PALMEIRAS BEAT NEW ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PALMEIRAS BEAT NEW ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>FOXBORO, Massachusetts 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palmeiras of</p>
<p>Brazil beat the New England Revolution of the United States</p>
<p>1-0 (halftime 0-0) in an exhibition soccer game at Foxboro</p>
<p>Stadium Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Euller, 70th minute</p>
<p>Attendance: 19,623</p>
